                    <Property name="text" type="java.lang.String" value="Operation System:&#xa;Linux based Debian operating system.&#xa;Recommended using Ubuntu 12.04&#xa;Terminal for accessing Iptables : gnome terminal 3.4.1.1 or newer&#xa;&#xa;Package:&#xa;Mysql version 5 or newer&#xa;Iptables version 1.4.12&#xa;JRE 1.6 or newer&#xa;&#xa;Network&#xa;ethernet card eth0 for source network/host&#xa;ethernet card eth1 for destination network/host"/>
